r print.png", "id": "246912787875696", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031311_246912791209029_5540108180063733703_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=TvMmMr4aCOIQ7kNvwF9b0tI&_nc_oc=Adogvva2SuF-cSScJmxcrgt8SlFfraIT7FqqJU-AW1T9HSLArMbxHFCDSJawS_982To&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKk0papwt4jZlFjO64Z43v_Wyh0bR9jQzlszJAie1zDkg&oe=6AB2936E"}, {"file_name": "Print 3.png", "id": "2170405556482566", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57572950_2170405559815899_5420058398011207589_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HBMN5N5KckYQ7kNvwFyazmL&_nc_oc=Ado_nJhmeLkMqvL1uNWSiH6i-eeW1VN-fCfAiqpT80GKUSu9gguMtNolcAqCWGf6f44&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKtsOK7E8XxgQWeue0SZCMe3ky7_NeFIhqgZf2AGHbOuQ&oe=6AB2A52F"}, {"file_name": "Print 5.png", "id": "921050275807580", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974548_921050279140913_846272164452751718_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=LupRc42SzSoQ7kNvwGIuxfm&_nc_oc=AdpaCAh1jYxRkT8q7WfRn7IkkV5sf75OaBA_72sKSGtp1G7s49P3Zu__XfRx8rxmK-8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLM3Lsx6Beoj8eWfn_ptu9lLQ8wVq8EqwlExXCGIMebDA&oe=6AB29817"}, {"file_name": "Print 2.png", "id": "1288706015050300", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_1288706018383633_3836298053771559642_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4bru7bZr58IQ7kNvwFK4ULu&_nc_oc=AdozBg_j8AHPLD4fTOZLrF3XLdPhilzFnMfz858eEtgm0mTYmR9lde5GQLM4k3-ADHw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUF7wFuzNd9RN6CqoU62DqLVhKmF-ONVzeBc-itehl5Q&oe=6AB2A1D1"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Final v.0.1 (eeve).png", "id": "945385240225978", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974721_945385243559311_50820886768660782_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xDT-R-d4ewQ7kNvwHwsna-&_nc_oc=Ado11fYHDPncE0C60nhdCysIrI8Cda72xlsQdsfrOD_JA56Tw4tIqA4IgbO-eGNiS-s&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQL1P8wcoo2kKmRUVBNw7GXuQE4thzvt_6sQT1sCcUcl3A&oe=6AB2A77C"}, "display_name": "My Room", "keywords": [], "long_description": "My Room is the game experience that allows you to interact with your friends and also create your own world.\n\nCustomize your character and explore our two game modes: Playground & My Room.\n\nIn the Playground you will find yourself in a multiplayer environment surrounded by minigames that are available to play with others. These games include:\n- Soccer: score as many goals as you can\n- Air Hockey (Arcade): play with the AI or with another player\n- Basketball (Arcade): throw the balls and try to score points\n- Cornhole (Arcade): have fun trying to score as you play with the bean bags\n- Darts (Arcade): practice your aiming in the available stations\n- Mini Golf (Arcade): try to aim the hole at the mini golf courses\nThe multiplayer also includes voice/text chat for you to communicate with other players\n\nWhen in My Room, you will be able to customize your own space. You can choose between 3 different themed templates, explore and change it the way you prefer.\n\n* Find more information about the gameplay itself the app*\n\nUpcoming updates in the near future:\n- Game monetary system\n- Shop\n- More games\n- More rooms\n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "Play minigames along with your friends in a multiplayer environment or explore and customize your own room with this experience."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "VResearch Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vresearchlab.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "ex